  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many 6’s are there in the octal representation of the decimal numbers from 675 to 700, inclusive?",
        "zh": "把十进制数675到700(包含675和700)用八进制表示,共会出现多少个数字6?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "9",
            "zh": "9"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "10",
            "zh": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "11",
            "zh": "11"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "12",
            "zh": "12"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "13",
            "zh": "13"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "The endpoints are $675_{10}=1243_8$ and $700_{10}=1274_8$. The numbers containing a 6 are 1246, 1256 and 1260 through 1267. There are ten such numbers; 1266 contains two 6s, so the total is **11**. The source solution misprints the first conversion as 1234.\n\nCount occurrences of the digit, not just numbers containing it; in particular, count both positions in $1266_8$. **Answer: C.**",
        "zh": "两个端点为 $675_{10}=1243_8$、$700_{10}=1274_8$。包含数字 6 的数是 1246、1256 和 1260 至 1267，共十个数；其中 1266 含两个 6，因此总共出现 **11** 个 6。原卷解析把第一个换算误印为 1234。\n\n统计的是数字 6 的出现次数，不是含 6 的数有几个；尤其要把 $1266_8$ 中的两个 6 分别计数。**答案：C。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
