    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate and express in base 16 if both numbers are hexadecimal.\n\n13 * 74F",
        "zh": "已知下方两个数字均为十六进制,计算并用十六进制表示结果。\n\n13 * 74F"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$8BDD_{16}$",
            "zh": "$8BDD_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$8ADD_{16}$",
            "zh": "$8ADD_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$7BDE_{16}$",
            "zh": "$7BDE_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "$8AEC_{16}$",
            "zh": "$8AEC_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "$8ACD_{16}$",
            "zh": "$8ACD_{16}$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "$13_{16}=10_{16}+3_{16}$. Multiplying $74F_{16}$ by $10_{16}$ shifts it one place to give $74F0_{16}$. Add that shifted value and three copies of $74F_{16}$. The units total $15+15+15=45$ in decimal, so write D and carry 2.\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rcccc}\n & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 2} &  \\\\\n & 7 & 4 & F & 0 \\\\\n &   & 7 & 4 & F \\\\\n &   & 7 & 4 & F \\\\\n+ &   & 7 & 4 & F \\\\\n\\hline\n & 8 & A & D & D\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nFor another hexadecimal calculation, use $74F_{16}=750_{16}-1$. Then $3\\cdot750_{16}=15F0_{16}$. Add the following two terms, then subtract 3.\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rcccc}\n &  & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  &  \\\\\n & 7 & 4 & F & 0 \\\\\n+ & 1 & 5 & F & 0 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 8 & A & E & 0\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$8AE0_{16}-3_{16}=8ADD_{16}$. In decimal, $19\\cdot1871=35549=8\\cdot16^3+10\\cdot16^2+13\\cdot16+13$. The product is $8ADD_{16}$ (option B).",
        "zh": "把 $13_{16}$ 拆为 $10_{16}+3_{16}$。$74F_{16}$ 乘以 $10_{16}$ 相当于左移一位，得 $74F0_{16}$，再加上三个 $74F_{16}$。个位和为十进制 $15+15+15=45$，写 D，向左进 2。\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rcccc}\n & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 2} &  \\\\\n & 7 & 4 & F & 0 \\\\\n &   & 7 & 4 & F \\\\\n &   & 7 & 4 & F \\\\\n+ &   & 7 & 4 & F \\\\\n\\hline\n & 8 & A & D & D\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n先将两个十六进制数转为十进制：$13_{16}=19$、$74F_{16}=1871$。因此\n\n$$\n19\\times1871=35549=8\\cdot16^3+10\\cdot16^2+13\\cdot16+13=8ADD_{16}\n$$\n\n还原十六进制时，数位值 10 写作 A，13 写作 D，所以结果为 $8ADD_{16}$，选 **B**。注意题目中的 13 也是十六进制，即十进制 19，不能直接按十进制 13 相乘。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
