    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find f(24) , given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} x+f(x-5) & \\text{if }x\\ge10\\\\ f(x+3)-4 & \\text{if }5<x<10\\\\ 2x-1 & \\text{if }x\\le5 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下条件,求f (24):\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} x+f(x-5) & \\text{当 }x\\ge10\\\\ f(x+3)-4 & \\text{当 }5<x<10\\\\ 2x-1 & \\text{当 }x\\le5 \\end{cases}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "9",
            "zh": "9"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "49",
            "zh": "49"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "56",
            "zh": "56"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "76",
            "zh": "76"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "80",
            "zh": "80"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "The function can be evaluated as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(24)&=24+f(24-5)=24+f(19)=24+56=80\\\\ f(19)&=19+f(19-5)=19+f(14)=19+37=56\\\\ f(14)&=14+f(14-5)=14+f(9)=14+23=37\\\\ f(9)&=f(9+3)-4=f(12)-4=27-4=23\\\\ f(12)&=12+f(12-5)=12+f(7)=12+15=27\\\\ f(7)&=f(7+3)-4=f(10)-4=19-4=15\\\\ f(10)&=10+f(10-5)=10+f(5)=10+9=19\\\\ f(5)&=2\\cdot5-1=10-1=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe chain stops at $x=5$, where the $x\\le5$ rule applies. In contrast, $x=10$ belongs to the $x\\ge10$ branch. Evaluate the base case first and then substitute upward; $f(24)=80$, **option E**.",
        "zh": "按递归调用顺序计算：\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(24)&=24+f(24-5)=24+f(19)=24+56=80\\\\ f(19)&=19+f(19-5)=19+f(14)=19+37=56\\\\ f(14)&=14+f(14-5)=14+f(9)=14+23=37\\\\ f(9)&=f(9+3)-4=f(12)-4=27-4=23\\\\ f(12)&=12+f(12-5)=12+f(7)=12+15=27\\\\ f(7)&=f(7+3)-4=f(10)-4=19-4=15\\\\ f(10)&=10+f(10-5)=10+f(5)=10+9=19\\\\ f(5)&=2\\cdot5-1=10-1=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n递归在 $x=5$ 时使用 $x\\le5$ 的终止规则；$x=10$ 则属于 $x\\ge10$ 分支。先算终止值，再向上代回，得到 $f(24)=80$，选 **E**。"
      },
      "source": {
