    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find f(3, 18) , given:\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\begin{cases} f(x-2,y+3)+3 & \\text{if }x>y\\\\ f(y-1,x+1)-5 & \\text{if }x<y\\\\ xy & \\text{if }x=y \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下条件,求f (3, 18):\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\begin{cases} f(x-2,y+3)+3 & \\text{当 }x>y\\\\ f(y-1,x+1)-5 & \\text{当 }x<y\\\\ xy & \\text{当 }x=y \\end{cases}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "139",
            "zh": "139"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "142",
            "zh": "142"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "143",
            "zh": "143"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "144",
            "zh": "144"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "148",
            "zh": "148"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "The function evaluates as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(3,18)&=f(18-1,3+1)-5=f(17,4)-5=148-5=143\\\\ f(17,4)&=f(17-2,4+3)+3=f(15,7)+3=145+3=148\\\\ f(15,7)&=f(15-2,7+3)+3=f(13,10)+3=142+3=145\\\\ f(13,10)&=f(13-2,10+3)+3=f(11,13)+3=139+3=142\\\\ f(11,13)&=f(13-1,11+1)-5=f(12,12)-5=144-5=139\\\\ f(12,12)&=12\\cdot12=144\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe $x<y$ rule changes the order of the arguments: $(3,18)$ becomes $(17,4)$, not $(2,19)$. At equality, use $xy$ immediately. Starting from $f(12,12)=144$ and restoring every pending +3 or −5 gives 143, **option C**.",
        "zh": "按递归调用顺序计算：\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(3,18)&=f(18-1,3+1)-5=f(17,4)-5=148-5=143\\\\ f(17,4)&=f(17-2,4+3)+3=f(15,7)+3=145+3=148\\\\ f(15,7)&=f(15-2,7+3)+3=f(13,10)+3=142+3=145\\\\ f(13,10)&=f(13-2,10+3)+3=f(11,13)+3=139+3=142\\\\ f(11,13)&=f(13-1,11+1)-5=f(12,12)-5=144-5=139\\\\ f(12,12)&=12\\cdot12=144\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n当 $x<y$ 时，规则会交换参数的角色：$(3,18)$ 变成 $(17,4)$，不是 $(2,19)$。两参数相等时立即用 $xy$ 终止。由 $f(12,12)=144$ 向上恢复每一层待执行的 +3 或 −5，最终得 143，选 **C**。"
      },
