    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "What Does This Program Do?",
        "zh": "程序分析"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "When this program is executed, what is the largest value of any variable?\n\n```text\na = 16: b = 4 : d =12\nc = a / b\nif a / c > d / b then\n    if a < 15 then\n        d = b + c\n    else\n        c = a + b\n    end if\nelse\n    if b > 3 then\n        a = a + d / b\n    end if\nend if\nif c > a then\n    t = a\n    a = c\n    c = t\nend if\nif a > b + c || a > d && a > b then\n    d = d + (a - c) ^ 2\nelse\n    a = a + b * d\nend if\n```",
        "zh": "执行以下程序后,在变量a, b, c, d中,最大的变量值是多少?\n\n```text\na = 16: b = 4 : d =12\nc = a / b\nif a / c > d / b then\n    if a < 15 then\n        d = b + c\n    else\n        c = a + b\n    end if\nelse\n    if b > 3 then\n        a = a + d / b\n    end if\nend if\nif c > a then\n    t = a\n    a = c\n    c = t\nend if\nif a > b + c || a > d && a > b then\n    d = d + (a - c) ^ 2\nelse\n    a = a + b * d\nend if\n```"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "28",
            "zh": "28"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "20",
            "zh": "20"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "16",
            "zh": "16"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "12",
            "zh": "12"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Trace the variables in execution order:\n\n| a | b | c | d |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 16 | 4 | — | 12 |\n| 16 | 4 | 4 | 12 |\n| 16 | 4 | 20 | 12 |\n| 20 | 4 | 16 | 12 |\n| 20 | 4 | 16 | 28 |\n\nAfter c becomes 20, a and c swap (temporary variable t=16). The last update gives $d=12+(20-16)^2=28$, the largest value of any variable.\n\nThe first condition is $16/4>12/4$, so it is true; the nested test $16<15$ is false, making $c=20$. In the final condition, $20>4+16$ is false, but both $20>12$ and $20>4$ are true, so the OR condition is true. Thus the update is to $d$, not to $a$. **Answer: A, 28.**",
        "zh": "按程序执行顺序记录变量的值：\n\n| a | b | c | d |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 16 | 4 | — | 12 |\n| 16 | 4 | 4 | 12 |\n| 16 | 4 | 20 | 12 |\n| 20 | 4 | 16 | 12 |\n| 20 | 4 | 16 | 28 |\n\nc 变为 20 后，a 与 c 交换（临时变量 t=16）。最后 $d=12+(20-16)^2=28$，这是所有变量出现过的最大值。\n\n首个条件为 $16/4>12/4$，成立；内层 $16<15$ 不成立，所以 $c=20$。最后一个条件中，$20>4+16$ 为假，但 $20>12$ 与 $20>4$ 都为真，因此整个或条件为真，执行更新 $d$ 的分支而非更新 $a$。**答案：A，28。**"
      },
